  "description": "PC/SC smart card SDK for .NET with APDU-level card and reader access. Provides direct winscard.dll integration, reader and card monitoring events, connection and protocol handling, and ATR access. Targets .NET Standard 2.0 and is compatible with .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET Core 2.0+, and .NET 5+ including .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10. Supports contact and contactless chip cards via optional CardWerk CardModules.",
